<title>HONG KONG: Cheung Kong Infra names deputy chairman.</title>
<headline>Cheung Kong Infra names deputy chairman.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cheung Kong Infrastructure Holdings Ltd said on Monday it has appointed Canning Fok as executive director and deputy chairman of the company with effect from March 10.</p>
<p>The company said it has also appointed Susan Chow as executive director with effect from the same date.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
